    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DuckStruck</strong> is a top down bullet hell pixel art shooter, where you play as... <strong>a duck!</strong> Featuring engaging battles with all kinds of duck enemies, and an epic OST made by Simeon G, your goal is simple: <strong>survive for as long as possible!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503020/extras/dd289756f99a724656dca10823c371e0.avif?t=1743208586\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build</strong>\u00a0using a variety of items, purchased in the shop using the in-game currency: <strong>Zombie Beans</strong>. Items include turrets, blocks, rail guns, sonar emitters, and much more! Use these items to fight back against the zombie ducks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503020/extras/6c8a3f98c432f0650ec3652502873896.avif?t=1743208586\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DuckStruck</strong> is a top down bullet hell pixel art shooter, where you play as... <strong>a duck!</strong> Featuring engaging battles with all kinds of duck enemies, and an epic OST made by Simeon G, your goal is simple: <strong>survive for as long as possible!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503020/extras/dd289756f99a724656dca10823c371e0.avif?t=1743208586\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build</strong>\u00a0using a variety of items, purchased in the shop using the in-game currency: <strong>Zombie Beans</strong>. Items include turrets, blocks, rail guns, sonar emitters, and much more! Use these items to fight back against the zombie ducks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503020/extras/6c8a3f98c432f0650ec3652502873896.avif?t=1743208586\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
